{"id":"n67193-1-16","stage":3,"title":"억양 · 语调","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67193-1-16-1","ko":"유민이는 목소리에 억양이 없어.","zh":"裕敏的声音没有语调啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"유민이는","meaning":"裕敏","explanation":"유민：裕敏；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"유민이는","audio":"/audio/727cddb4c6676098ab15.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"목소리에","meaning":"嗓音，声音","explanation":"목소리：嗓音，声音；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"목소리","audio":"/audio/47febdd9f8a457359397.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69464","senseId":"1","lemma":"목소리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"억양이","meaning":"语调，抑扬","explanation":"억양：语调，抑扬；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"억양","audio":"/audio/5e1a0794be782c704c61.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67193","senseId":"1","lemma":"억양","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없어.","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"4","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"47febdd9f8a45735","term":"목소리","zh":"嗓音，声音","audio":"/audio/47febdd9f8a457359397.mp3","entryId":"69464","definition":"从人喉咙里发出的声音。","pronunciation":["목쏘리"]},{"id":"5e1a0794be782c70","term":"억양","zh":"语调，抑扬","audio":"/audio/5e1a0794be782c704c61.mp3","entryId":"67193","definition":"使声音的高低发生变化；或指那样的变化。","pronunciation":["어걍"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"某物不多。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/cfc4eb5c7bb78103d01c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67193-1-16-2","ko":"응. 높낮이가 없으니까 로봇 같아.","zh":"对，因为没有高低起伏，听起来像机器人一样。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"높낮이가","meaning":"高低","explanation":"높낮이：高低；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"높낮이","audio":"/audio/017b16739f465e10f9db.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"45286","senseId":"1","lemma":"높낮이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없으니까","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；으니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"4","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"로봇","meaning":"机器人","explanation":"로봇：机器人","readings":[{"term":"로봇","audio":"/audio/7c3bf7bf31cbc94c5804.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15538","senseId":"1","lemma":"로봇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"相似，如同，像","explanation":"같다：相似，如同，像；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"2","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"017b16739f465e10","term":"높낮이","zh":"高低","audio":"/audio/017b16739f465e10f9db.mp3","entryId":"45286","definition":"高和低；或高或低的程度。","pronunciation":["놈나지"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"某物不多。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]},{"id":"7c3bf7bf31cbc94c","term":"로봇","zh":"机器人","audio":"/audio/7c3bf7bf31cbc94c5804.mp3","entryId":"15538","definition":"模仿人的整体或某个身体部位而制成的，能够模仿人类活动或工作的机器。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"相似，如同，像","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"互相差不多。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/32a466b371255b3b0d6a.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.226,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=6